WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.450
Open the account menu, at the top right.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.314
Choose Arabic.

3
00:00:07.314 --> 00:00:11.650
Your account switches to Arabic, and reads right to left.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:17.350
Your choice is remembered on this device.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:28.760
To switch back, open the same menu, and choose English.
